### Register employer (409 if exists)
POST http://localhost:8083/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.employer@matchhire.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "firstName": "Demo",
  "lastName": "Employer",
  "userType": "EMPLOYER"
}

### Register candidate (409 if exists)
POST http://localhost:8083/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.candidate@matchhire.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "firstName": "Demo",
  "lastName": "Candidate",
  "userType": "CANDIDATE",
  "skills": ["Java", "Spring", "SQL"]
}

### Invalid data -> 400
POST http://localhost:8083/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short",
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "X",
  "userType": "CANDIDATE"
}